a plan-county with several links (a plan split across successors, a move
into another contract, or a consolidation) enters them once per link. The
\verb{_once} columns count each plan-county once and use the plan-county exit
flag \code{forced_county}; their December and January totals match CMS's
totals for the same plans.

Suppressed CMS cells (1-10 enrollees) count as 10; \verb{_low} columns count
them as 1.
